# SHOWSTOPPER: stage II, the Night Freight: one screen on the roof of a
# moving train, fourteen waves to outlast and no boss. Off the roof (or
# down a gap between the cars, but for the walkway in the middle) is a
# fall. The last wave beaten, the stage is clear.
game showstopper
wait 5
cheat run
cheat stage 2
cheat god
expect cam == 0
expect wave == 0
waituntil wave == 1 100
expect foes == 2
expect kind_10 == 2
cheat clear
waituntil wave == 2 100
expect kind_11 == 3
cheat clear
waituntil wave == 3 100
expect kind_12 == 1
cheat clear
# the walkway between the cars holds, the gap beside it doesn't
cheat mortal
cheat pos 90 88
hold RIGHT 20
expect pstate == 0
cheat pos 104 72
hold RIGHT 6
expect pstate == 2
wait 40
cheat god
cheat clear
cheat wave 14
waituntil state == 4 300
